  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Every existing AssignTaskRecipientGate / AssignTaskNotifier test passes unmodified (the behaviour baseline), including task 207's Administrative cases.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The gate calls ContactUserRepresentation.ResolveAsync with DecideOnLink; the copied representation code is removed; SeveralUsers still refuses; eligibility still after the count; Restricted read once.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A table test over the representation outcomes (none, one active, one inactive, several, column missing, bound oid resolving elsewhere) gives the same warning codes as on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, filtered tests (AssignTask, Signals, ExternalAccess) and full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
